# 1. PRODUCT VISION

## Product name
GST Reconcile AI

## Tagline
From GST discrepancies to resolved actions.

## Product description
GST Reconcile AI is an AI-assisted GST reconciliation and compliance intelligence platform that helps Indian businesses and accounting professionals process supplier invoices, compare purchase records with GSTR-2B, identify discrepancies, investigate their causes, coordinate supplier follow-ups, and maintain an auditable history of unresolved issues.

The platform combines:

- Multimodal AI-powered invoice understanding.
- Deterministic GST reconciliation.
- Evidence-based discrepancy investigation.
- AI-generated supplier communication.
- Human-reviewed corrective actions.
- Cross-period discrepancy tracking.
- Audit-ready reporting.

## Core workflow

Invoice ingestion → Structured extraction → Purchase register import → GSTR-2B import → Deterministic reconciliation → Discrepancy investigation → Supplier follow-up → Human approval → Resolution tracking → Reports.

The product must make this workflow easy to understand and demonstrate.

