The above is illustrative data, not a real invoice.

## Important extraction rules

- Never invent missing fields.
- Use null when a value is unavailable.
- Preserve original invoice numbers.
- Do not silently alter GSTINs or amounts.
- Distinguish extraction confidence from factual correctness.
- Validate extracted values in backend code.
- Flag low-confidence or inconsistent fields for human review.
- Do not treat an AI extraction result as a verified financial record until accepted by the user.

