These rules are mandatory.

1. Gemini is responsible for document understanding, explanations and communication drafts.
2. The backend is responsible for calculations, validation, reconciliation and access control.
3. Do not use an LLM as the source of truth for financial calculations.
4. Never silently modify invoice amounts.
5. Never silently confirm uncertain matches.
6. Never invent missing GSTR-2B entries.
7. Never claim a supplier has failed to file based solely on an uploaded file.
8. Never claim an ITC amount is legally eligible or ineligible without applicable verified rules and human review.
9. Never claim to have submitted a GST return.
10. Preserve source evidence and user corrections.
11. All important AI-generated recommendations must be reviewable.
12. All financial and compliance actions must remain auditable.

